This project adapts provider-contract research and selected implementation
patterns from OpenUsage:

  https://github.com/robinebers/openusage
  tag v0.7.6
  commit 5a2864f19a1c664f6a140ba06abad5596000af10
  provider updates through commit 9d2bf09f10e21f769494a525a9d65c84d7aeb1df

The adapted areas include Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Antigravity, GitHub
Copilot, Devin, and Grok credential discovery, OAuth refresh and usage-request
behavior, quota response mapping, selected monochrome provider icon paths, the
bounded subprocess runner, and private atomic credential-file replacement.

